nship.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>What this job really is</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Right in the middle of it.</strong> From day one you’re part of our implementation team and work on operational and strategic topics alike. Your work goes straight into real customer projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership that grows with you.</strong> You work side by side with our Implementation Managers and own parts of real customer implementations from early on. The more you prove yourself, the more you own.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>In the room where it happens.</strong> You help prepare workshops with procurement teams at DAX and Fortune 500 companies, and you’re there when they happen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>When the stakes are high, you’re there.</strong> Go-lives and critical moments happen in war rooms. You’re part of the team that gets it done, and you’ll learn more in those days than in any lecture hall.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Beyond implementation.</strong> Trade fairs, events, internal initiatives: wherever Lio needs a hand, you jump in and see how a hypergrowth startup really works.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Find your path.</strong> You’ll see implementation, product, engineering and sales up close. We’ll help you figure out where you want to go, and then help you get there.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you should know before you apply</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re <strong>in the office five days a week.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is <strong>not a typical internship and not 9 to 5</strong>. We grow faster than our processes can keep up, and some weeks are intense. In return, you’ll learn more in six months than in years anywhere else.</p