li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We're Looking For</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Pursuing or recently completed a degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Engineering, or a related field</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong SQL skills and basic Python experience</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of relational databases, data modelling, and ETL/ELT concepts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity about business, data, and how technology solves real problems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enthusiasm for adopting AI-powered development tools like Claude to build, automate, and solve problems faster</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong problem-solving skills, attention to detail, and willingness to learn</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">High ownership, you enjoy figuring things out and seeing them through</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficiency in English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Available for a minimum duration of 6 months</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bonus Points</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with BigQuery, dbt, or modern data warehouses</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with APIs, Git, Fivetran, or other data integration tools</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to data governance, semantic layers, or self-service analytics</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interest in SaaS metrics, revenue analytics, or product analytics</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Personal or university projects involving real-world data</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>What We Offer</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exciting and challenging work with real impact and ownership at one of Europe’s fastest-growing Series 