vestment infrastructure for the next 100 million retail investors in Europe.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>You will:</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>50% Shipping value: </em>Own engineering outcomes and operational health in your domain. Set clear goals with Product and Operations, ruthlessly drive focus and clarity, and remove blockers so engineers can ship valuable work consistently.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>40% Growing people: </em>Hire, develop and retain engineers, growing the next generation of technical leaders. Set clear expectations, give regular feedback and manage performance. Create a high‑energy environment where strong people want to join, stay and grow.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>10% Engaging technically: </em>Stay close enough to the code and systems to earn the respect of senior ICs. You fly high but can dive deep: reviewing designs, engaging in technical discovery and incident follow‑ups, and using your technical judgment to ask sharp questions and make trade‑offs.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive focus and closure. Shape your teams’ ways of working so that they tackle a small number of high‑impact initiatives at a time, and push dependencies, blockers or incidents, to clear decisions and outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Product and Operations to define the strategy and goals for your domain.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Raise the bar on quality, reliability, and security. Co-own domain posture with senior ICs and ensure big technical work is justified and deliverable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow strong ICs into leaders. Identify high‑potential engineers and give them clear ownership, stretch projects, and feedback so they can grow into Senior+ roles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Foster trust, productive conflict, and knowledge sharing within your teams. Build trust, productive conflict, and knowledge sharing. Celebrate wins and clearly communicate your team’s impact cross-functionally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expand your team with great engineers.  Work with senior leadership on headcount, team structure, and role definitions as we scale</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Operations to identify possibilities to improve operational efficiency.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div></li></ul><h2><strong>You will be successful in this role if:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You have gained profound technical leadership experience as Engineering Manager or Head of Engineering.</strong> You have led and grown one or more backend-heavy teams in a fast-paced environment and achieved ambitious goals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Brokerage, payment, or financial services excite you. </strong>Ideally, you had prior touch points to Fintech professionally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Have solid experience with API-first, cloud-based architectures</strong>, and know what good looks like in terms of reliability, observability, security, and incident response in production systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You take pride in being technical.</strong> You can read and review well-structured, tested code in a modern high-level language, challenge designs and trade-offs, and bring a pragmatic engineering perspective to product discussions without needing to be the primary implementer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You have a deep understanding of software development processes</strong> and their failure modes, and know how to set a team up for success.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are an empathic leader that can inspire others</strong>. You know how to encourage strong (cross-functional) collaboration, develop your team members and foster a strong sense of collaboration across the whole team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You have an intrinsic motivation to understand the product and business side of things.</strong> You are keen to contribute to &amp; influence the wider company direction and culture.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for people with passion, desire to learn and that are team players. You're encouraged to apply, even if your experience doesn't precisely match the job description. Your skills and passion will stand out - and set you apart - especially if your career has taken some extraordinary twists and turns.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we Take Care of You:</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🚀 Compensation package:</strong> We offer you a competitive salary, based on your experience and the value-add you bring to<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI" href="http://lemon.markets/" title="http://lemon.markets/"><u> </u></a><u>lemon.markets</u>.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🕑 Flexible working hours: </strong>We trust people to choose when they work best and avoid a rigid 9 to 5 mindset. You decide on the rhythm that helps you do your best work, with only shared core hours from 12:00 to 16:00 to support collaboration.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏢 Hybrid work setup:</strong> You can work from anywhere in Germany within a hybrid model. At the same time, in-person collaboration is a key part o