.5em">You have any questions? Feel free to contact us via <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI" ----- ---------- style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/lemon-markets/engineering-manager-customer-lifecycle-berlin-177269","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin (Hybrid)","created_at":1795729210},{"slug":"founding-full-stack-engineer-ai-berlin-355747","company_name":"Limetax","title":"Founding Full Stack Engineer – AI (m/f/d)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Berlin · Full-time · Start ASAP</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Limetax</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Limetax is building the agentic-first accounting and tax group for German SMEs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We acquire established accounting and tax advisory firms and onboard them to our proprietary agentic platform, combining deep industry expertise with AI-native technology.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by $40m in equity and debt from top-tier investors, we're building and scaling a new kind of accounting &amp; tax group in Germany.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our founders bring significant experience across M&amp;A, operations, and AI-native technology, having previously built and scaled unicorns, Razor Group and Augustus.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The Role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a <strong>Founding Full Stack Engineer</strong>, you'll build the product our tax professionals use every day, from databases and backend services to the interfaces and AI features that bring it together.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your initial focus will be bookkeeping: understanding how documents become accounting entries, where manual work slows people down, and how software and AI can make the process better.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work directly with tax professionals to understand their workflows, decide what's worth building, and turn ambiguous problems into useful product features. You'll prototype quickly, test with users, and take what works into reliable production.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work closely with our engineering team and founders, with real ownership of the features you ship and how they perform in practice.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You'll Work On</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Full-stack Product Engineering.</strong> Build complete features across our TypeScript stack, with React on the frontend and NestJS on the backend. Own the user experience, APIs, and data model together.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bookkeeping Workflows.</strong> Build systems for document processing, booking proposals, review, and accounting integrations. Make workflows and their exceptions explicit so users and engineers can understand how they work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Applied AI.</strong> Build LLM-powered features, agents, and retrieval systems that reduce manual work. Decide where AI adds value, where deterministic logic is needed, and where users should stay in control.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Rapid Prototyping.</strong> Turn user problems into small, working versions quickly. Use modern development tools, including AI coding tools, to experiment, learn, and improve what you ship.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Backend &amp; Data Integrity.</strong> Design APIs, relational data models, and integrations with systems such as DATEV. Handle validation, duplicate processing, and failures deliberately.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Production Ownership.</strong> Take features through testing, deployment, monitoring, and iteration. Evaluate AI behavior against real examples and investigate failures across the stack.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Direct User Feedback.</strong> Stay close to German-speaking tax professionals, understand what helps them, and use their feedback to guide the next improvement.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your Profile</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are a strong software engineer.</strong> You have shipped full-stack products that real users rely on. You're comfortable writing frontend code and have strong backend, API, SQL, and database design skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You have strong product intuition.</strong> You ask why a problem matters, challenge assumptions, and choose a useful first version. You care about whether people can use what you build and whether it improves their work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You have high agency.</strong> You move from an unclear problem to working software, make pragmatic decisions, and take responsibility for your delivery. You enjoy experimenting with new tools and approaches.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You make complex workflows understandable.</strong> You can explain the process, sketch its states and exceptions when useful, and communicate what changed and how you validated it. You keep this practical and lightweight.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You build with AI.</strong> You have hands-on experience building features with LLMs, agents, or AI-enabled workflows, and understand their limitations. Experience operating these features in production is a plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You care about reliability.</strong> You know when a quick prototype is enough and what needs to change before users depend on it, especially when handling financial data.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You speak professional German and fluent English.</strong> You can work directly with our tax advisory teams in German and collaborate with our engineering team in English. You're based in Berlin or willing to relocate for on-site work.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why Limetax</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Immediate operational impact.</strong> Build software that directly changes how accounting and tax work gets done.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>End-to-end ownership.</strong> Take features from understanding the workflow through implementation, deployment, and continuous improvement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tight feedback loops.</strong> Work directly with the people using your product, with access to real workflows, documents, and domain expertise.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Applied AI in production.</strong> Solve problems where accuracy, reliability, and human judgment matter.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build at an early stage.</strong> Help shape the product, architecture, and engineering practices as Limetax scales across firms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Meaningful upside.</strong> Competitive cash compensation plus meaningful equity.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","r