&lt;li&gt;Build account plans for each MSP and take them from first conversation through technical evaluation, pricing and contracting to expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through outbound prospecting and joint activity with partners and distributors, so new MSP revenue is created, not waited for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide MSPs on service design and pricing models so they can bring Rubrik to market profitably and win more of their own customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Rubrik&#39;s distribution partners to onboard and enable MSPs, so they can license and resell Rubrik quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell with MSPs and Rubrik&#39;s regional sales teams to help customer opportunities across Germany close faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with MSP solution architects and system engineers across EMEA to turn technical wins into signed business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share what you learn in the German market with MSP leadership and help shape how the team works in the region as it grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of enterprise software or security sales experience, including selling to or through managed service providers in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A record of building your own pipeline and closing seven-figure deals against a multi-million annual quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of managed services and cloud business models, including the commercial side of building a service offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships with managed service providers and system integrators in the German market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Germany and the wider DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A resourceful, entrepreneurial approach: you build momentum without waiting for structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a software vendor in data management, cyber security or infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributors and MSP licensing or consumption programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data protection, backup or cyber recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience covering Austria or Switzerland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-CH2 #LI-remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/rubrik/remote-msp-account-executive-dach-338050","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Remote","created_at":1795708521},{"slug":"junior-account-executive-gestalte-die-zukunft-der-tech-kommunikation-munchen-bavaria-242662","company_name":"Axicom","title":"(Junior) Account Executive (m/w/d) - Gestalte die Zukunft der Tech-Kommunikation!","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;We are Axicom, part of WPP, an award-winning global communications agency for tech-driven brands. We bring together a diverse team of PR professionals passionate about integrated communications and telling the transformative stories of technology. With offices in the Netherlands, United States, United Kingdom, Spain, Italy, Germany, France, Sweden, Brazil, and Mexico, we are the largest global agency specializing in tech communication.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re proud to be recently recognized as Agency of the Future, Disruptive Agency of the Year, and Best PR Network to Work For (EMEA). This underscores our commitment to innovation, growth, and fostering a collaborative culture. Since 1994, we&#39;ve delivered ground-breaking campaigns for the world&#39;s most innovative tech companies, and we are always seeking new talent to join our team of Futurists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;Hyperlink SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW259761513 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist Du bereit, die Zukunft der Innovations- und Technologie-Kommunikation zu gestalten?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vergiss langweilige PR. Bei Axicom erzählen wir nicht nur Geschichten – wir gestalten die Zukunft für die innovativsten Tech-Marken der Welt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir sind ein preisgekröntes Team (Provoke&#39;s Best Agency to Work for EMEA Network 2024, Tech Agency of the Year Shortlist 2024, Provoke&#39;s Most Disruptive Agency of the Year 2025) und suchen Dich ab sofort als (Junior) Account Executive zur Verstärkung für unser Team in München.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du brennst für Technologie, liebst gute Geschichten und möchtest in einem Umfeld arbeiten, in dem &quot;Futurists not Followers&quot; nicht nur ein Motto ist, sondern gelebte Realität? Dann lies weiter!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wer wir sind:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Axicom ist die einzige globale Tech-Kommunikationsagentur innerhalb von WPP.&lt;/strong&gt; Das bedeutet, Du bekommst die Kultur und Agilität einer Boutique-Agentur mit der Power und den Ressourcen des weltweit größten Marketing-Dienstleistungsunternehmens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wir sind&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;die technologisch fortschrittlichste Kommunikationsgruppe weltweit&lt;/strong&gt;: Durch die Verbindung der Kreativität unserer Mitarbeitenden mit der Kraft von KI eröffnen wir neue Möglichkeiten für führende Tech-Brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vergiss starre Regeln.&lt;/strong&gt; Unser Arbeitsmodell gibt Dir die Freiheit und Balance, die Du brauchst, um erfolgreich zu sein. Wir vertrauen Dir und unterstützen Dich dabei, Deinen Arbeitstag optimal zu gestalten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unsere Kultur begeistert.&lt;/strong&gt; Wir sind innovativ und streben immer nach mehr – für uns selbst, füreinander und für unsere Kunden. Wir gewinnen gemeinsam und halten uns gegenseitig den Rücken frei.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zu deinen Aufgaben gehören:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kunden- &amp;amp; Teammanagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Du bist das Bindeglied, hältst Projekte am Laufen, managst die täglichen Aktivitäten und baust Beziehungen zu deinen Kunden, den Medien und Kollegen auf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Medienarbeit: &lt;/strong&gt;Du liebst Nachrichten und aktuelle Trends? Perfekt! Du identifizierst Chancen, baust Beziehungen zu Journalist:innen auf und hilfst uns, die besten Stories zu platzieren. Du erstellst überzeugenden Content – von Pressemitteilungen bis Social Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projektmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Vom Organisieren von Events bis hin zu umfassenden Recherchen – Du bringst Dinge ins Rollen, antizipierst Herausforderungen und findest kreative Lösungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Chancen: &lt;/strong&gt;Du hilfst uns, neue Möglichkeiten zu erkennen, analysierst den Wettbewerb und trägst zu spannenden Pitches bei, um neue Kunden zu gewinnen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bringst Du mit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein abgeschlossenes Hochschulstudium (Marketing, Kommunikation, Geisteswissenschaften o.ä.) sowie idealerweise erste Praktika in der PR auf Agentur- oder Unternehmensseite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technologie und digitale Trends begeistern Dich und Du hast ein Gespür für News und Innovationen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du liebst kreatives Denken und hast ein ausgeprägtes Storytelling-Talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kommunizierst verhandlungssicher auf deutscher wie englischer Sprache und hast eine ziel- und lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Als Teamplayer hast Du Lust, Verantwortung zu übernehmen und proaktiv mitzugestalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine Agentur, die Tech-Kommunikation neu definiert und den Zeitgeist der Branche prägt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle mit branchenführendem Intelligent Working-Ansatz und Vertrauenskultur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein dynamisches und inklusives Arbeitsumfeld, in dem Du Dich entwickeln und Dein volles Potenzial ausschöpfen kannst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein Team, das Unterschiede schätzt, Besonderheiten feiert und gemeinsam Erfolge erreicht&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persönliche Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten durch eine Vielzahl an Schulungen, LinkedIn Learning und maßgeschneiderte Fortbildungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lust, uns kennenzulernen und Teil unseres Teams zu werden?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dann freuen wir uns auf Deine Bewerbung inklusive Deines möglichen Eintrittsdatums und Deiner Gehaltsvorstellung an.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Axicom:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Axicom, a Burson Group company, to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axicom, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/axicom/junior-account-executive-gestalte-die-zukunft-der-tech-kommunikation-munchen-bavaria-242662","tags":["Media Relations - Axicom"],"job_types":[],"location":"München, Bavaria","created_at":1795708520},{"slug":"senior-product-engineer-full-stack-berlin-49635","company_name":"Andercore","title":"Senior Product Engineer (Full Stack)","description":"<h2><strong>About Andercore</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Andercore is the AI-native supplier of industrial materials and goods for energy and infrastructure. We execute trade and distribution end-to-end, on our own account, at the speed of compute - and we are becoming the supplier of record for the entire industry.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Industrial procurement is a €900B market in Europe alone and the largest manual market on earth. 95% of customers have no direct access to global supply chains. Materials pass through four or five intermediaries before they reach a site, and 40% of the margin evaporates on the way. For decades, the operating system of this industry was people: people to source, negotiate, finance, ship, and sell.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We built the alternative from scratch. We are the supplier. We buy from global sources and sell to European customers on our own account. Our AI runs the full trade: sourcing, quality, pricing, sales, logistics, credit, and financing. One request. A firm quote in minutes. Delivered on time. For the customer, it feels like buying from their preferred local supplier. No warehouses. No fleet. No inventory risk. Every trade is pre-sold before it is bought.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are also the credit counterparty. Customers are scored and insured in minutes and get up to 60 days of payment terms priced into the quote itself. The working capital behind every trade is bank-funded, not equity-funded.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Where we are today:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong triple-digit-million euro turnover run rate, the majority of it from repeat customers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Seven European markets live, sourced from suppliers across Asia and beyond</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">80+ people across Berlin (HQ), London, and Shanghai</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">$90M raised in equity and debt, including our $40M Series B, from Atomico, Project A, Target Global, and Inven Capital - with working capital facilities from UniCredit and KfW</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">The margin is in the bits. The moat is in the atoms. We are building the supplier of record for industrial materials - and redefining how global trade works in one of the largest and most essential industries on earth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Andercore runs global trade end to end, from sourcing and pricing to sales, logistics and financing, and much of that work is done by AI agents. Agents are only as good as the product around them: reliable data, well-designed APIs, and interfaces where our team can review, correct and approve what an agent proposes before real money and real shipments move.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Senior Product Engineer, you own business problems end to end. You talk to the people who use what you build, decide with Product what to solve, and ship the whole slice: data model, services, AI agents and the user interface. You work in a domain where prices and stock change daily, supplier data arrives in every possible format, and a wrong number costs money. You set the quality bar for the team and make the engineers around you better.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tech stack</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Java 21 and Spring Boot 3, Python, LangGraph and LLM APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini), PostgreSQL, Kinesis, AWS with Terraform, GitHub Actions, and TypeScript with Node.js, Next.js and React. You don't need to know all of it on day one. We use AI coding tools heavily and expect you to pick up whatever part of the stack the problem needs.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own a business problem from first conversation to production and beyond, for example making supplier pricing reliable from ingestion all the way to the quote a salesperson sends.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build backend services for pricing, inventory, orders and the integrations that connect suppliers, customers and logistics partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build our AI agents and the tools and APIs they use, and make their actions safe through idempotency, validation, audit trails and human review where it matters.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and build the interfaces where our commercial teams work with agents: reviewing proposals, correcting mistakes and approving decisions quickly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn messy external data such as supplier price lists, datasheets and stock feeds into trustworthy data the rest of the business relies on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Measure whether what you shipped works, including evaluating and monitoring LLM-driven workflows in production.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead technical decisions, write down the trade-offs, and mentor other engineers through code review, pairing and direct feedback.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help us hire by running interviews and defining what good engineering looks like at Andercore.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>In your first six months, you might </strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a pricing engine that scales with our growing assortment and number of markets, and serves correct prices to sales, and later directly to customers, in milliseconds.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automate procurement: turn supplier price lists, quotes and order confirmations into structured data, and let AI agents handle the manual steps between our buyers and suppliers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least 5 years of experience building and running software in production, with real users and real consequences when it fails.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong backend skills at production scale in Java or a comparable language such as Kotlin, C# or Go, and willingness to work in Java and Spring Boot. Experience designing distributed, event-driven systems, with a focus on data correctness and failure modes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid command of PostgreSQL and hands-on experience with AWS.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your depth is on the backend, but full-stack delivery is expected: you build frontends in TypeScript and React. You don't need to be a frontend specialist, but you can ship a good interface for the problem you own.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product sense: you ask why before how, you talk to users, and you can turn a vague problem into a clear plan.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in a fast-growing company, where priorities shift and you keep shipping while the business changes around you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of solving business problems, not only technical ones.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building with LLMs or agent frameworks is a strong plus. Curiosity and good engineering judgment about them is a must.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You raise the level of the people around you, and you push back when something doesn't make sense.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in trading, marketplaces, supply chain, fintech or other domains where data errors cost money is a bonus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Practical details</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Location: Berlin, hybrid</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working language: English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A learning budget for your development</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Start date: As soon as possible</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are an equal-opportunity employer and welcome applicants from all backgrounds, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, or any other characteristic. We believe that diversity drives innovation, creativity, and collective strength.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/andercore/senior-product-engineer-full-stack-berlin-49635","tags":["Platform Development"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1795707619},{"slug":"head-of-it-and-security-munich-135894","company_name":"Proxima Fusion GmbH","title":"Head of IT and Security","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>WHO WE ARE</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proxima Fusion is Europe’s fastest-growing fusion company and the continent’s best-funded fusion player, as well as the first spin-out from the Max Planck Institute for Plasma Physics (IPP). Backed by over €650M and powered by a growing team across Munich, Zurich, and Oxford, we are developing the hardware and infrastructure needed to deliver the world’s first commercial stellarator fusion power plant.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our concept advances the most mature fusion technology out there, the Wendelstein 7-X stellarator, through two next-generation machines: Alpha and Stellaris. Our work combines stellarator optimization, advanced computation, machine learning, and high-temperature superconducting magnets to unlock higher-performance designs that were previously out of reach.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turning these designs into a functioning fusion power plant requires excellence and ownership across every discipline, from physics and engineering to software, manufacturing, law, and business functions.<br /><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>WHY JOIN US</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work on a civilisation-scale problem</strong> - Clean, baseload fusion energy is one of the few genuinely world-changing challenges, and every hire directly accelerates the path to a working stellarator.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Grow as fast as the company does</strong> - With headcount set to roughly 5x in a few years and major technical milestones ahead on the path to our demo machine and first power plant, your role grows under you; today's hire is tomorrow's function lead.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tackle problems that don't exist elsewhere</strong> - Fusion sits at a rare intersection of deep-tech R&amp;D, industrial procurement, government relations, and venture financing, so non-tech functions face challenges no other workplace can offer.<br /><br /></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>YOUR IMPACT</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As our Head of IT &amp; Security in Munich, you will own IT and security across all of our sites: reliable systems so our people can work quickly, protection for one of the most valuable bodies of fusion IP in Europe, and the evidence that our controls work.<br /><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>WHAT YOU WILL DO</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead and grow our IT Operations and Security team, and own the roadmap and budget.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run helpdesk, devices, identity, networks and business systems, including ERP. Set one service standard across sites, including for IT onboarding and offboarding.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep security assurance separate from IT delivery. Report security risks, service performance and remediation progress to leadership using live system data.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the ISMS, security policies, incident response and business continuity. Assign owners to security alerts and drive vulnerability remediation, including patching, through verified closure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take accountability for NIS2 compliance and the path to ISO 27001 certification, with evidence ready for audits and due diligence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Get the full value from Google Workspace Enterprise, GCP and our security tools, and enforce device management, endpoint protection, SSO, MFA and access controls.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set physical security standards for site access, cameras, visitors, monitoring and escalation. Bring in specialist expertise early to assess site risks and verify controls through commissioning.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the cyber configuration, identity integration and security logging of connected access-control and camera systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and verify security controls for lab, test-data and operational technology systems, with clear handling of exceptions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage our IT and security partners, contracts, service levels and licences, and match spend to what we use and need.<br /></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>WHO YOU ARE</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have built and led IT or security across multiple sites or countries in a growing technology, engineering or industrial company, and can lead both disciplines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have owned an ISMS and led ISO 27001 certification or a comparable security compliance programme.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have hands-on depth in Google Workspace, identity and device management, endpoint security, SIEM and networks, and can review a firewall rule or access policy yourself.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You turn security risks, digital and physical, into practical controls and check that they work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have managed teams, budgets and partners against clear priorities and measurable outcomes.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice to have</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with Google SecOps or another Google-centric security stack.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience implementing NIS2 requirements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with ERP, lab, test-data or operational technology systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in a startup, scale-up, regulated or high-security environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German.<br /><br /></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>INTERVIEW PROCESS</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Recruiter Interview (30-45 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical Screening (60 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Panel Interviews (3x60 min)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CEO call (30 min)<br /><br /></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role sits at L4 of our framework, please inquire during the recruitment process for further information.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>At Proxima Fusion, our mission is bold: making limitless clean energy a reality. To get there, we need a high-performing, diverse team that brings different perspectives, challenges assumptions, and builds together with purpose. We know that diversity of thought and experience leads to better ideas, stronger execution, and a more resilient team. We don’t look at how you identify, what you look like, who you choose to worship or what ethnicity you are. We care about what you can bring to the table.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/proxima-fusion-gmbh/head-of-it-and-security-munich-135894","tags":["Business Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Munich","created_at":1795707615},{"slug":"property-acquisition-and-management-specialist-hamburg-298232","company_name":"Zeal Network","title":"Property Acquisition and Management Specialist (w/m/d)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">ZEAL Network SE ist eine international tätige Unternehmensgruppe und Deutschlands führender Anbieter von Online-Lotterien mit den Marken LOTTO24 und Tipp24. Gemeinsam mit Partnern wie ONCE sowie innovativen Angeboten wie Freiheit+, Traumhausverlosung, Traumautoverlosung und ZEAL Ventures gestalten wir die Zukunft digitaler Lotterien und investieren in neue Geschäftsmodelle. Unser vielfältiges Team aus über 350 Mitarbeitenden verbindet Innovationsgeist, Zusammenarbeit und das gemeinsame Ziel, Menschen dabei zu unterstützen, ihre Träume zu verwirklichen.</p><h1><strong>Deine Mission:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Als House Sourcing &amp; Management Specialist (w/m/d) ist es deine Aufgabe, regelmäßig einzigartige Immobilien für unsere Traumhausverlosung zu entdecken, die unsere Teilnehmer:innen begeistern. Dabei geht es nicht nur um Quadratmeter, sondern um das Besondere, das Außergewöhnliche – um Häuser zum Träumen, eben echte Traumhäuser.</p><h1><strong>Deine Aufgaben:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du spürst besondere Bestandsimmobilien auf, die sich perfekt für unsere Verlosungen eignen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du baust Beziehungen zu Eigentümer:innen, Projektentwickler:innen und anderen relevanten Ansprechpartner:innen auf und pflegst diese. Ziel ist es, kreative und unkonventionelle Wege zum Erwerb attraktiver Immobilien zu finden.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du steuerst den gesamten Prozess von der ersten Besichtigung bis zur Übergabe an unsere Gewinner:innen und kümmerst dich um alle dazwischenliegenden Schritte.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du führst die Kaufverhandlungen und stellst sicher, dass alle Verträge fair sind und den erforderlichen Standards entsprechen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du koordinierst externe Partner:innen wie Gutachter:innen, Handwerker:innen und weitere Fachkräfte, die uns bei der Vorbereitung der Immobilien für die Verlosung unterstützen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du organisierst die administrative Übergabe der Häuser an unsere Gewinner:innen und sorgst für einen reibungslosen Ablauf.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du betreust unser Immobilienportfolio vom Ankauf bis zur Übergabe an die Gewinner:innen. Du koordinierst Hausverwaltungen, Versorgungsunternehmen und Versicherungen, veranlasst notwendige Instandhaltungsmaßnahmen, behältst Verträge, Fristen und laufende Kosten im Blick und stellst sicher, dass alle Immobilien gepflegt und ausreichend versichert sind.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>Was du mitbringst:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du bringst langjährige Erfahrung im privaten Wohnimmobilienbereich mit, hast Immobilientransaktionen eigenständig gesteuert und verantwortet und kannst erfolgreich abgeschlossene Transaktionen der vergangenen Jahre nachweisen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du verfügst über fundierte Kenntnisse der Immobilien- und Hauspreise sowohl deutschlandweit als auch in unseren jeweiligen Zielregionen und kannst Preisvorstellungen kritisch hinterfragen. Idealerweise bringst du zudem Maklererfahrung in Zweitwohnsitzmärkten und Ferienregionen außerhalb Deutschlands mit.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du besitzt ein sehr gutes analytisches Verständnis, ausgeprägtes unternehmerisches Denken und starkes Verhandlungsgeschick.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du erkennst sofort, was eine Immobilie einzigartig macht, und weißt, wie du sie für Fotos oder Besichtigungen perfekt in Szene setzt, um einen echten Wow-Effekt zu erzielen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du kannst professionelle Netzwerke aufbauen und Projekte von Anfang bis Ende planen und umsetzen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du verstehst, was Menschen sich von einem Zuhause wünschen, und findest Immobilien, die diese Wünsche erfüllen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du bist ein echtes Networking-Talent und pflegst Kontakte zu potenziellen Immobilienverkäufer:innen ebenso souverän wie zu Makler:innen oder Gutachter:innen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du arbeitest eigenständig und bringst Reisebereitschaft mit, um die besten Immobilien für uns zu finden.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du hast eine ausgeprägte Owner-Mentalität und packst gerne selbst mit an. Du scheust dich nicht davor, neue Ideen umzusetzen oder unkonventionelle Wege zu gehen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Du verfügst über ausgezeichnete Kommunikationsfähigkeiten in Deutsch und Englisch, sowohl mündlich als auch schriftlich.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>What we offer you:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A modern, dynamic culture grounded in the success of a leading-edge e-commerce company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A talented team of ambitious, like-minded colleagues where your knowledge and ideas truly make an impact.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ongoing personal growth, supported by an annual development budget of €1,500 to invest in your professional development.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Trust and autonomy, no micromanagement, just confidence in your ability to deliver and excel.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible work options with a hybrid setup focused on results.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unlimited vacation days in addition to your yearly 30-day vacation allowance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Opportunity for workations abroad using our WorkFlex tool.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monthly mobility allowance of €30 to use on the mobility option of your choice (e.g., the Deutschlandticket), plus access to a company bike leasing program.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Company pension scheme, provided in partnership with Degura, to support your future financial security.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Subsidized EGYM WELLPASS membership, with a contribution of only €25 per month, giving you access to a wide range of gyms and sports options across Germany.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monthly company events, team activities, and informal gatherings, including our popular company-wide lunches provided four days a week.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Was wir anbieten:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Eine moderne, dynamische Unternehmenskultur, basierend auf dem Erfolg eines innovativen E-Commerce-Unternehmens.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ein talentiertes Team aus ambitionierten, gleichgesinnten Kolleg*innen, in dem dein Wissen und deine Ideen wirklich etwas bewegen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Kontinuierliche persönliche Weiterentwicklung, unterstützt durch ein jährliches Weiterbildungsbudget von 1.500 €, das du in deine berufliche Entwicklung investieren kannst.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Vertrauen und Eigenverantwortung – kein Mikromanagement, sondern echtes Vertrauen in deine Fähigkeiten, hervorragende Ergebnisse zu liefern.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible Arbeitsmöglichkeiten mit einem hybriden Arbeitsmodell, das auf Resultate fokussiert ist.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unbegrenzte Urlaubstage zusätzlich zu deinem regulären Urlaubsanspruch von 30 Tagen pro Jahr.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Möglichkeit zu Workations im Ausland über unser WorkFlex-Tool.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monatlicher Mobilitätszuschuss von 30 €, den du für das Verkehrsmittel deiner Wahl nutzen kannst (z. B. das Deutschlandticket), sowie Zugang zu einem Fahrrad-Leasing-Programm.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Betriebliche Altersvorsorge in Zusammenarbeit mit Degura zur Absicherung deiner finanziellen Zukunft.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Geförderte EGYM WELLPASS-Mitgliedschaft – du zahlst nur 25 € pro Monat und erhältst Zugang zu zahlreichen Fitnessstudios und Sportangeboten in ganz Deutschland.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monatliche Firmenevents sowie regelmäßige Teamaktivitäten und informelle Treffen –