tive and unconventional ways to acquire attractive properties.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You manage the entire process from the first viewing to the handover to the winners and take care of all the steps in between.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You lead the negotiations and ensure that all contracts are fair and up to standard.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You coordinate external partners such as surveyors, tradesmen and other professionals who help us prepare the properties for the raffle.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will organise the administrative handover of the houses to our winners and ensure that everything runs smoothly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You manage our property portfolio from acquisition through to handover to the winners. You coordinate property managers, utility providers and insurers, arrange necessary maintenance, keep track of contracts, deadlines and running costs, and ensure all properties are well maintained and adequately insured.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>What you offer us:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have extensive experience in the private residential property sector, have independently led and taken responsibility for property transactions, and can demonstrate a track record of successful deals closed in recent years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Challenger competence through knowledge of property/house prices nationally and in our individual target regions, at best brokerage experience from second home markets and holiday regions outside Germany</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Very good analytical understanding, business acumen and strong negotiating skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You immediately recognise what makes a property unique and how to stage the perfect ‘money shot’ for photos or viewings to achieve the wow effect.</p></li><li><p style="min-height