salary + equity in a high-growth startup.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our Operating Principles</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong><br /></strong><em><strong>Extreme Ownership</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We take full responsibility for our work, outcomes, and team success. No excuses, no blame-shifting — if something needs fixing, we own it and make it better. This means stepping up, even when it’s not “your job.” If a ball is dropped, we pick it up. If a customer is unhappy, we fix it. If a process is broken, we redesign it. We don’t wait for someone else to solve it — we lead with accountability and expect the same from those around us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Craftsmanship</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Putting care and intention into every task, striving for excellence, and taking deep ownership of the quality and outcome of your work. Craftsmanship means never settling for “just fine.” We sweat the details because details compound. Whether it’s a product feature, an internal doc, or a sales call — we treat it as a reflection of our standards. We aim to deliver jaw-dropping customer experiences by being curious, meticulous, and proud of what we build — even when nobody’s watching.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>We are “majos”<br /></strong></em>Be friendly &amp; have fun with your coworkers. Always be genuine &amp; honest, but kind. “Majo” is our way of saying: be a good human. Be approachable, helpful, and warm. We’re building something ambitious, and it’s easier (and more fun) when we enjoy the ride together. We give feedback with kindness, challenge each other with respect, and celebrate wins together without ego.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Urgency with Focus<br /></strong></em>Create the highest impact in the shortest amount of time. Move fast, but in the right direction. We operate with speed because time is our most limited resource. But speed without focus is chaos. We prioritize ruthlessly, act decisively, and stay aligned. We aim for high leverage: the biggest results from the simplest, smartest actions. We’re running a high-speed marathon — not a sprint with no strategy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Talent Density and Meritocracy<br /></strong></em>Hire only people who can raise the average; ‘exceptional performance is the passing grade.’ Ability trumps seniority. We believe the best teams are built on talent density — every hire should raise the bar. We reward contribution, not titles or tenure. We give ownership to those who earn it, and we all hold each other to a high standard. A-players want to work with other A-players — that’s how we win.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>First-Principles Thinking<br /></strong></em>Strip a problem to physics-level facts, ignore industry dogma, rebuild the solution from scratch. We don’t copy-paste solutions. We go back to basics, ask why things are the way they are, and rebuild from the ground up if needed. This mindset pushes us to innovate, challenge stale assumptions, and move faster than incumbents. It’s how we build what others think is impossible.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>The personal data provided in your application and during the selection process will be processed by Happyrobot, Inc., acting as Data Controller.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>By sending us your CV, you consent to the processing of your personal data for the purpose of evaluating and selecting you as a candidate for the position. Your personal data will be treated confidentially and will only be used for the recruitment process of the selected job offer.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>In relation to the period of conservation of your personal data, these will be eliminated after three months of inactivity in compliance with the GDPR and legislation on the protection of personal data.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>If you wish to exercise your rights of access, rectification, deletion, portability or opposition in relation to your personal data, you can do so through ----- subject to the GDPR.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>For more information, visit</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.happyrobot.ai/privacy-policy"><em> <u>https://www.happyrobot.ai/privacy-policy</u></em></a></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>By submitting your request, you confirm that you have read and understood this clause and that you agree to the processing of your personal data as described.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/happyrobotai/forward-deployed-engineer-german-speaking-munich-66691","tags":["Deployment"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Munich","created_at":1795707612},{"slug":"talent-acquisition-partner-tech-hamburg-494921","company_name":"eleQtron GmbH","title":"Talent Acquisition Partner - Tech (f/m/d)","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">This is for the person who's looking for their next growth challenge in recruiting. You can close a hard search, you know how to talk to candidates who aren't looking, and your current role has started to feel a little too comfortable.</span></p><h3></h3><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">At eleQtron, you can still help write our next chapter and decide how we get there. We build quantum computers, with about 130 people across Hamburg and Siegen. Most of the people we need are physicists, engineers and software specialists who are sought-after talent. We’re still shaping how eleQtron finds them, how it tells them why they should join, and how we evolve our approach to hiring. That's the job you can define.</span></p> <br> <h4>What you'll do</h4><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">You'll sit inside our technical teams as their talent partner. You'll learn how each team works, where it’s strong and where the gaps are. You'll shape the brief and the bar with the hiring manager, pushing back where you have to.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You'll run our hardest searches yourself, from mapping the market to closing the offer and helping people relocate. Most of those hires will be people you found rather than people who applied.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">With the team, you'll work out why a strong scientist or engineer should join eleQtron, and you'll make sure the people we want to hire hear it, through universities, conferences and research networks as well as the usual (and unusual) channels.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You'll build the way we hire: structured interviews, scorecards and debriefs that every technical team uses, with the data to show whether they work. You'll coach our hiring managers and interviewers to that standard.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><span style="color:#121317">You'll have the freedom &nbsp;to be creative in how you source, and to use AI for the research and admin, so your time goes on judgement and on conversations with people.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>This is for you if</h4><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">You've outgrown your current role and want to build something.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You start things without waiting to be asked, and you finish them.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You move with urgency when the picture is still unclear.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You'd rather shape an employer brand than inherit one.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><span style="color:#121317">Hard technical searches interest you more than easy ones.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">You don't need to have built a recruiting function before. If you have, that helps, but what matters more is your appetite to continually improve and push us forward. If you haven't, we care more that take initiative without being asked and you to and seen it through, taking the time to learn what worked, or not.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>What’s worth knowing</h4><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">Our People team has a lot to deliver. You'll build while you hire, and the hiring won't wait for the building to finish. Some searches will take months, and the people you talk to will be comparing us with big tech and research labs. You'll also spend regular time at both our Hamburg and Siegen sites.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">So this probably isn't for you if:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">You want a settled process to run.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You're happy with the way things are and want to keep them that way.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">You'd rather someone else decided how hiring should work.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><span style="color:#121317">You need a clear path with little ambiguity.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3><strong>What you'll bring</strong></h3><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You've recruited scarce technical specialists from start to finish: finding people who weren't looking, persuading them, and closing them through offer and relocation. You’re used to be rejected or ghosted.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You've worked closely with technical leaders and shaped what they hire for, with evidence to back your view.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You can show us something you initiated that had a meaningful impact without waiting to be asked to do it.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">You're fluent in English. German is a plus.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">It helps if you've also built a hiring process, worked on an employer brand or coached other people to a standard. If you haven't, curiosity, a growth mindset and pace go a long way.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h3>How we hire</h3><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">A 40-minute call with our Head of People &amp; Culture to find out more about you, your background and experiences, and how this could fit into the role at eleQtron.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">A 45-60 min light hands-on case study with a short fictional brief that you’ll work through with the hiring manager.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">A practical exercise: 60 minutes with one of our technical hiring managers, to work through a live role-intake and search calibration meeting to assess how you apply your knowledge, work directly with a key stakeholder and how you get to the most effective outcome together.</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">**You can also have an informal coffee with the other team members at any point.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Please note, that this job will remain online until the 19th of December for new applications at which point it will be closed.</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">If you've read this far and you're already thinking about what you'd change first, we'd like to hear from you!</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/eleqtron-gmbh/talent-acquisition-partner-tech-hamburg-494921","tags":["Human Resources"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Hamburg, Hamburg, Germany","created_at":1795707090},{"slug":"product-owner-softwareentwicklung-oberkochen-242644","company_name":"encontec GmbH","title":"Product Owner Softwareentwicklung (m/w/d)","description":"<h3>Product Owner Softwareentwicklung (m/w/d)</h3><figure><img style="width:2280px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/cvorm356ks/1.jpg"></figure><p>Bei unserem namhaften Kunden im Raum Aalen - einem führenden Unternehmen der Hightechindustrie - bietet sich diese einmalige Perspektive im Rahmen der Arbeitnehmerüberlassung mit der Option auf Übernahme.<br></p><h3>Dein zukünftiger Tätigkeitsbereich</h3><ul class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf xeuugli x1717udv x1ghz6dp x11v4sto x10of0ok xe8uvvx xy09zc5 x1ovvlb x1kw3rcc x104jwf5 x1lziwak x15472z4 x43c9pm xld8u84 xtaz4m5"><li><p class="x1ghz6dp x1717udv x1wty727 x1pd3egz x4gjf66 x15eiy0f x1lziwak x15472z4 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1lliihq x14rh7hd xg07evd">Weiterentwicklung der Product Vision einer anspruchsvollen Softwarelösung für die Produktion optischer Hightech-Systeme in enger Zusammenarbeit mit dem Scrum-Team</p></li><li><p class="x1ghz6dp 