&lt;p&gt;Our concept, “Technology, done differently”, embodies our belief that the way our customers&amp;nbsp;consume and utilize technology&amp;nbsp;should innovate at the same pace as the technology itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our customers range from small start-ups to global enterprises. From designing, deploying and managing infrastructure stacks within low-latency financial trading environments, to relocating the headquarters of a global fintech firm, our operations span multiple markets, industries and geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Techary have helped customers scale their operations globally, gain an advantage in financial markets, enabled mission-critical projects and, most importantly, implemented technology that delivers alpha-accelerating business transformation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(71, 215, 172);&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Talent Acquisition (TA) and People Operations Resourcer to join our fast-growing talent team. Techary has more than doubled in size since 2024, and with 50+ hires to make, you will be at the heart of our next stage of growth. You will be the first voice candidates hear from us, running screening calls, keeping Greenhouse in shape and sourcing for our harder-to-fill roles. You will also support people operations with administration tasks and learn our HR processes as you go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role comes from a full diary of calls every week, a high share of your shortlists reaching second interview, and close collaboration with hiring managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(71, 215, 172);&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Talent acquisition&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run first-round screening calls by phone and video, for inbound applicants and candidates you have sourced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put forward candidates hiring managers want to meet, with a high share of shortlists reaching second interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the ATS for your roles, keeping Greenhouse accurate, candidates in the right stages and nobody left waiting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source candidates for harder-to-fill roles through LinkedIn Recruiter and other channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with hiring managers to book interviews and gather feedback quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep candidates warm and informed at every stage of the process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;People ops&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administration tasks, and the chance to learn our HR processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate background checks and right-to-work verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and the employee lifecycle, including starters, leavers and internal changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain employee records and HR documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare starter paperwork, including contracts and onboarding packs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the HR team with day-to-day queries and general administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help with wider people initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #47d7ac;&quot;&gt;Essential Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years’ recruitment experience, in-house or agency, ideally as a resourcer, sourcer or junior recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident screening candidates by phone and video, with the ability to build rapport and ask the right questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using LinkedIn Recruiter to source and approach candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage a high volume of roles and candidates at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and persistent, keeping candidates and roles moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appetite for fast-paced growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #47d7ac;&quot;&gt;Desirable Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with an ATS or HRIS, ideally Greenhouse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing for harder-to-fill roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in building people operations experience alongside recruitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #47d7ac;&quot;&gt;Why Techary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Growth that is real. &lt;/em&gt;Revenue grew 84.7% in 2025, entirely organically, with no outside investors, and we remain profitable. We have been in The Sunday Times 100 two years running, climbing from 75th to 59th.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;A team that is scaling fast. &lt;/em&gt;We have grown from 65 people in January 2024 to 150 today, and AI-powered tools are in use across every team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;A great place to work. &lt;/em&gt;Our engagement score is 8.2 out of 10 against a 6.9 national average, and 8.8 out of 10 would recommend us.&lt;/li&gt;
