&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Open and flat. &lt;/em&gt;Monthly company-wide meetings, and you can speak openly with anyone in the business, including senior leadership and the CEO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
