&lt;li&gt;A positive attitude and a passion for sharing knowledge - the go-to person on the team for small and large questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in fintech, markets, and trading is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge or high interest in our main tools: Java, event-driven architectures (AMQP or similar), gRPC, service meshes, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsession with finishing projects properly, with good stakeholder management, communications, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
