&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee cyber risk, third-party risk and vendor resilience assessments, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to strengthen risk identification, prioritisation and informed decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and implement governance models, dashboards, Important Business Services (IBS), Impact Tolerance (ITOL) frameworks and reporting mechanisms, ensuring appropriate validation, auditability, human oversight and escalation where AI-assisted tools are utilised.&lt;/p&gt;
