&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead cyber and technology resilience transformation initiatives, including tooling, cloud security and control enhancements, while contributing to business development, proposition development and capability growth.&lt;/p&gt;
