&lt;p&gt;Location: Edinburgh or Glasgow | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime | Type: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of global regulatory reporting transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is seeking a Managing Principal (Director level) to lead our Trade &amp;amp; Transaction Reporting capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp;amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. This role combines strategic leadership with extensive regulatory reporting expertise and experience delivering complex, multi-jurisdictional transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner with global financial institutions to deliver regulatory change, optimise reporting controls and support sustained compliance across key reporting regimes, including EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, CFTC, HKMA and MAS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also promote AI-enabled ways of working, helping clients and teams responsibly use approved AI tools, automation and data-driven insights to enhance reporting quality, strengthen data governance and improve operational efficiency. You&#39;ll ensure appropriate human judgement, validation, auditability and responsible AI practices remain central to regulatory reporting transformation and client solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead end-to-end trade and transaction reporting transformation programmes across multiple global regulatory regimes, identifying opportunities to improve reporting quality and operational efficiency through approved AI tools, AI-enabled workflows and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advise clients on regulatory implementation, remediation and control optimisation across EMIR Refit, MiFIR, SFTR, HKMA, MAS, CFTC and other reporting frameworks, ensuring appropriate governance, regulatory compliance and human oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, assess and enhance reporting architectures, data lineage, reconciliations and data quality frameworks, using AI-enabled analytics where appropriate to improve reporting accuracy, transparency and control effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide the implementation of regulatory reporting platforms and RegTech solutions, ensuring responsible AI adoption, appropriate validation, auditability and effective oversight of AI-assisted outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead strategic client relationships, proposition development, business growth and thought leadership within Capco&#39;s Regulatory Reporting capability, identifying opportunities for responsible AI-enabled innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Extensive experience leading trade and transaction reporting transformation programmes across multiple global regulatory regimes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of transaction reporting regulations, reporting controls, reconciliations, data governance and regulatory operating models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of capital markets products, including OTC derivatives, listed derivatives, equities, fixed income and FX.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with reporting technology, automation and AI-enabled solutions, including an understanding of responsible AI governance, human oversight and regulatory compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience engaging executive stakeholders, developing strategic client relationships, guiding consulting teams and delivering large-scale transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
