s into revenue while learning every stage of the sales process.</p></li><li><p>Develop the commercial skills needed to progress into a closing role, including influencing, negotiation and relationship building.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Using your incredible communication skills to build brand new relationships between Patsnap and potential clients&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Working closely with an Account Executive, who will mentor and help to develop your sales skills, while you support their activity by creating sales leads and booking their product demonstrations&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Owning your territory and choosing which companies to call and will have the autonomy to be creative with how you introduce Patsnap to prospects&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Learning the necessary tools to be able to succeed in the role; what we ask of you is a can-do attitude and an open mind to learning&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Researching using varied and creative techniques to identify business opportunities (sales leads)</p></li></ul> <br> <h4>What We'd Love From You</h4><p>You don't need previous sales experience – we're looking for people with the attitude, curiosity and ambition to build a successful career in tech sales. You could be starting your professional career, moving into sales from another sector or bringing some initial B2B sales or lead-generation experience.</p><p>We're looking for someone who is:</p><ul><li><p>A recent graduate (or early career professional) or has B2B sales or lead generation experience, ideally within the software industry (desirable)&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Ambitious and motivated by success, with the drive to excel in an uncapped commission environment.</p></li><li><p>Confident and proactive, comfortable starting conversations and building relationships with new people.</p></li><li><p>Resilient and determined, with the mindset to overcome challenges and thrive in a target-driven environment.</p></li><li><p>Naturally competitive, with a strong desire to achieve goals and progress quickly in your career.</p></li><li><p>An excellent communicator, able to explain complex scientific concepts in a simple, engaging way.</p></li><li><p>Curious, coachable and eager to learn, always looking for ways to improve.</p></li><li><p>Organised and self-motivated, with the ability to manage your time and priorities effectively.</p></li><li><p>Passionate about technology, AI and innovation, and excited by the impact they have on R&amp;D and scientific discovery.</p></li><li><p>A natural problem solver who enjoys understanding customers' challenges and helping them find solutions.</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working in a fast-paced, collaborative environment where no two days are the same.</p></li></ul><h4></h4><h4>Benefits &amp; Perks:</h4><p>A genuinely strong sales culture we’re really proud of. High-performing but low ego, social, and dynamic. It’s a team that supports each other, shares best practice, raises standards, and celebrates wins properly together. Alongside a great product, it’s one of the best parts of working here.</p><p><strong>Additional benefits</strong></p><ul><li><p>25 days annual leave plus bank holidays</p></li><li><p>Two paid volunteering days</p></li><li><p>Private healthcare with AXA</p></li><li><p>Pension with Scottish Widows</p></li><li><p>Enhanced parental leave policies</p></li><li><p>Work from home stipend</p></li><li><p>Cycle to Work scheme</p></li><li><p>Life assurance</p></li><li><p>Payroll giving options</p></li><li><p>Eyecare vouchers</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Compensation:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Base Salary: £28,330 + uncapped commission</p></li><li><p>On-Target Earnings Total (OTE): £47,217 (60/40 split)</p></li><li><p>High achievers regularly exceed target, with earnings of £60k+</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/compa