<p data-path-to-node="14"><strong data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="0">Culture &amp; Leadership</strong></p>
<ul data-path-to-node="15">
<li>
<p data-path-to-node="15,0,0">Drive studio-wide initiatives that shape overall design culture, recruitment practices, and the integration of AI into design workflows.</p>
