<p data-path-to-node="18,0,0"><strong data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">End-to-End Design Leadership:</strong> Demonstrated ownership of complex, ambiguous product initiatives from greenfield ideas to launch within fast-paced tech environments.</p>
