height:1.5em">Earned 190K+ GitHub stars, making us one of the world’s Top 40 most popular projects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by top investors, from Sequoia’s first German seed to our SAP's recent strategic investment - bringing us to a $5.2bn valuation</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />That’s the company we’ve built. Now we’d love to see what <em>you </em>can build. If you’re applying, try n8n out - whether you’re technical or not - and share a screenshot of your first workflow with us. The easiest place to start is here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🎯 Your main goal will be to win and grow Enterprise customers by becoming the trusted partner of technical teams and their leaders.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As an Enterprise Account Executive covering Benelux (Belgium and the Netherlands), you will own a territory of larger organisations and drive complex deals from first conversation to signature:</p><h3>GENERATE NEW-LOGO PIPELINE</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and execute account plans for named Enterprise accounts with 1,001 to 5,000 employees.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run outbound campaigns that open doors with CTOs, engineering leaders and platform teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn community adoption and inbound signals into structured enterprise opportunities.</p></li></ul><h3>LEAD COMPLEX, MULTI-STAKEHOLDER DEALS</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run deep discovery, quantify business impact and build a business case with your champions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Map decision makers across engineering, IT, security and procurement and keep every thread alive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Solutions Engineers on technical evaluations and proofs of concept.</p></li></ul><h3>CLOSE AND EXPAND</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the sales cycle through security, legal and procurement reviews, typically over two to four months.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Negotiate with confidence and keep clear commercial control of next steps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hand over to Customer Success and plan expansion across teams and use cases.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3>Must-haves</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏢 Enterprise SaaS sales:</strong> You have sold B2B SaaS into organisations of roughly 1,001 to 5,000 employees and can explain customer size, deal complexity and cycle length.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧑‍💻 Technical buyers:</strong> You have sold to developers, engineers, CTOs, CIOs and DevOps or platform teams, and you explain complex products without leaning on a Solutions Engineer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧩 Complex deals:</strong> You have run multi-stakeholder cycles of two to four months and closed meaningful deals in organisations of 1,001 to 5,000 employees.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🎯 New-logo hunter:</strong> You generate your own pipeline through outbound and win new customers rather than living off expansion or inbound.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📈 Track record:</strong> You have consistently hit or exceeded quota over the past two to three years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧭 Structured selling:</strong> You use a structured methodology (MEDDPICC or similar is a plus) and navigate technical evaluations, procurement, legal and security reviews.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📍 Location:</strong> You are based in Belgium or the Netherlands, and you already have the right to work there.</p></li></ul><h3>Nice-to-haves</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🛠️ Technical product background:</strong> You have sold developer tools, cloud infrastructure, data, AI or automation platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🚀 Startup or open-source exposure:</strong> You have worked at an open-source, product-led or Series A to C company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤝 Technical network:</strong> You already know engineering and IT leaders in your territory.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will win Enterprise customers with a product technical teams already love, and you will help define how we sell to larger organisations as the segment takes shape. You will work closely with Solutions Engineers, Customer Success, Partnerships and Product, so your voice carries weight. n8n is growing at an exceptional pace, backed by a vibrant community and a remote-first culture built on autonomy, experimentation and high talent density. Apply now and help us bring AI-powered automation to the world’s most ambitious companies.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>n8n is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We can sponsor visas to Germany; for any other country, you need to have existing right to work.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Our company language is English.</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>You care about diversity and inclusion? We do too! Check out our </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.notion.so/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35?pvs=21"><em>Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging initiatives at n8n</em></a><em> (</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.notion.so/n8n/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35"><em>https://www.notion.so/n8n/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35</em></a><em>).</em></p><h2></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Location disclaimer:</strong> If you see multiple job postings for the same role, it is most likely because we're hiring remotely for this role and posting in different locations to make sure every potential candidate can see the role. Please apply to the location you're the most likely to work from in the future. </em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Benefits </strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Competitive compensation</strong> 💸 – We offer fair and attractive pay.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ownership</strong> 💪 – Our core value is to “empower others,” and we mean it—you’ll get a slice of n8n with equity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work/life balance</strong> 🏖️ – We work hard but ensure you have time to recharge:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Europe:</strong> 30 days of vacation, plus public holidays wherever you are.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>US:</strong> 20 vacation days, 8 sick days, plus public holidays wherever you are.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Health &amp; wellness</strong> 🩺 –</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Europe:</strong> We provide benefits according to local country norms.*</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>US</strong>: Multiple low-premium, low-deductible medical plans with coverage for individuals and families—plus a no-cost premium HDHP option with a pre-seeded HSA—along with dental and vision coverage.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Future planning</strong> 💰 –</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Europe:</strong> We provide pension contributions according to local country norms.*</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>US:</strong> 401(k) retirement plan with a 4% employer match.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Financial security</strong> 🛡️ –</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Europe:</strong> We provide benefits according to local country norms.*</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>US: </strong>Company-paid short-term and long-term disability insurance, plus life insurance to support you and your loved ones.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Career growth</strong> 📈 – We hire rising stars who grow with us! You’ll get €1K (or equivalent) per year to spend on courses, books, events, or coaching to level up your skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A passionate team</strong> 🤩 – We love our product, and we prove it with regular hackathons where we see who can build the coolest thing with it!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remote-first</strong> 🌏 – Our team works remotely across Europe, with regular off-sites for team bonding. Some roles, like sales in the US, are hybrid—please check the job description.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Giving back</strong> 🤝 – We're big fans of open source, and you'll get $100 per month to support projects you care about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transparency</strong> 🙏 – We all know what everyone’s working on, how the company is doing—the whole shebang.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>*Country and/or State specific details provided in your employment agreement.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/n8n/enterprise-account-executive-benelux-remote-benelux-netherlands-454653","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1795664586},{"slug":"founding-account-manager-smb-nl-netherlands-amsterdam-272037","company_name":"Dandy","title":"Founding Account Manager, SMB (NL)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Dandy is transforming the massive and antiquated dental industry—an industry worth over $400B. Backed by some of the world’s leading venture capital firms, we’re on an ambitious mission to simplify and modernize every function of the dental practice through technology. As we expand our reach globally, Dandy is building the operating system for dental offices around the world—empowering clinicians and their teams with technology, innovation, and world-class support to achieve more for their practices, their people, and their patients.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the Role<br /></strong>Dandy is looking for a Founding Account Manager in Amsterdam to join the growing team and delight our customers: dentists across the country. New customers will be transitioned directly from sales to you, and you will quickly build your portfolio to 100+ accounts. </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">As the owner of your book of business, your primary focus will be on driving Net Revenue Retention (NRR) by proactively fostering strong customer relationships, activating new user (doctor) growth, and expanding into new locations. You will collaborate closely with Sales, Training, and Customer Support to drive customer satisfaction and ultimately customer retention.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You'll Do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Book Management</em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive NRR through strategic account planning and proactive customer engagement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Utilize data and customer feedback to analyze your book of business and formulate a plan on customer engagement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use a mix of service and sales skills to manage the doctor experience during critical moments of Dandy’s customer journey</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Commercial Sales</em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify and execute upsell and cross-sell opportunities within your given book of business</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive activations of more users / doctors within a practice</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive sales of additional scanners within a practice</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive expansion through selling into additional practice locations</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Client Relationship Management</em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and maintain strong, long-lasting relationships with doctors at key accounts to foster trust and loyalty</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Provide consultative solutioning and negotiate commercial terms with doctors through a nuanced understanding their goals and feedback</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experiment and execute on churn reduction strategies</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Clinical Knowledge</em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deeply understand the operations of a dentistry practice and the competitive market of digital dentistry to better engage with doctors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have ability to speak in the language of clinicians in order to problem solve and be a partner to the customers</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Continuous Improvement</em></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ex